        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……コースの状態は良。第2、第3コーナーまで距離がある関係で、\n先行争いは激しくならない。9人立て。逃げ予想は1人――",
            "enText": "…The track condition is good. Since there's distance before \nthe second and third corners, the battle for the front won't be \ntoo fierce. A nine horsegirl field. Predicted pacesetters: one.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 373,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
