            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（4番が抑えきれない様子で上がってくる。\nこれは……パッと、思いつくのは）",
            "enText": "(Number four is moving up, looking like she can't hold back. \nThis is… The first thing that comes to mind is…)",
