        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……色んな意味で、クロノジェネシスから目が離せない。\n考えられたペース配分。キレのある末脚。勝利への執念――",
            "enText": "…In more ways than one, I couldn't take my eyes \noff Chrono Genesis. Her calculated pace distribution. \nHer sharp final spurt. Her belief in victory ——",
