        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "実を言うと、これは監視でもあった。クロノジェネシスが\n無理をしすぎた際にはすぐさまフォローできるように、という。",
            "enText": "To tell the truth, this was also a form of surveillance. \nThat way, if Chrono Genesis pushed herself too hard, \nI could immediately step in to support her.",
